# TanStack Router

Code-based routing only — see `.cursor/skills/tanstack-router` (not file-based / `autoCodeSplitting`).

- Tree + lazy pages: `apps/web/src/routeTree.tsx` (`LazyPage`, Play → `prefetchPlayPage` + `PlaySkeleton`)
- Boot / Register / default 404·error: `apps/web/src/main.tsx`
- Titles: `head: () => pageHead(…)` + root `<HeadContent />` (`seo.ts`)
- `/play` search: `validatePlaySearch` + `getRouteApi("/play")`
- Narrow subscriptions: `useRouterState({ select })` / `useSearch({ select })`
- **Never** idle-preload Play (ENABLE); warm on Play intent only
- New route checklist + upstream links: skill `tanstack-router`
